   3.9775171504203053`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f78c6d9d-e512-43af-be45-\
4ce704b0cbf4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The code is hosted on GitHub. The implementation, tests, and visualizations \
are not explained in this notebook. Explanations appear in ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["an earlier notebook",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3605564"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3605564"],
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 ". But we can run them here, for assurance. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9771486526215887`*^9, 3.977148750788342*^9}, {
  3.977150414216207*^9, 3.9771504621456337`*^9}, {3.9773249092258463`*^9, 
  3.977324964816276*^9}, {3.977331379516541*^9, 3.977331413431841*^9}, {
  3.977649491042904*^9, 3.977649505801241*^9}, {3.977649544131277*^9, 
  3.977649546793685*^9}, {3.9776496005086193`*^9, 3.977649610571004*^9}, {
  3.978360913057309*^9, 
  3.9783609136155987`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b220de8d-1b18-42bc-8118-\
2c3b9816689e"],

Cell["\<\
The toolkit is currently implemented as a Script rather than as a package for \
development speed and for transparency. That means that all symbols will be \
loaded into the Global namespace, including internal variables in Module \
constructs. This minor inconvenience will be mitigated in a future version.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978188523075684*^9, 3.978188555596314*^9}, {
  3.978189800818763*^9, 
  3.9781899399767933`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"da8f7ccf-a0a9-4130-aa63-\
e88f0076ac7e"],

